cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "rsb3: B3 public files as Arrow/Parquet (strict COTAHIST parser with integer-cent prices)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Leite"
    given-names: "André"
    email: "leite@castlab.org"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4718-9766"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-22"
repository-code: "https://github.com/milkway/rsb3"
url: "https://crates.io/crates/rsb3"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - B3
  - Bovespa
  - COTAHIST
  - finance
  - Arrow
  - Parquet
  - Rust
abstract: >-
  rsb3 downloads, validates and converts the public files of B3, the Brazilian
  stock exchange, into Arrow/Parquet. Its COTAHIST parser reads the official
  245-byte fixed-width historical quotes file strictly and keeps prices as
  integer cents.
